VALUES ('mysuru', 'Mysuru (Mysore)', 'mysuru', 'ಮೈಸೂರು', 'South Karnataka', 'South Karnataka', 'The Royal Heritage City of Palaces', 'The cultural capital of Karnataka, celebrated for the majestic Amba Vilas Palace, fragrant sandalwood, Devaraja Market silk, Chamundi hill temple, and grand Dasara festivities.', 'Mysuru', 'September to March', '2 - 3 Days', 'Moderate & balmy, glorious evenings, grand Dasara illumination in Oct', 12.2958, 76.6394, '{"Royal Palaces","Hoysala Architecture","Mysore Pak Tasting","Silk & Sandalwood"}', 5, '{"imageUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Mysore_Palace_Morning.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mysore_Palace_Morning.jpg","photographer":"Wikimedia Commons / Muhammad Mahdi Karim","license":"GFDL 1.2","attribution":"Wikimedia Commons / GFDL 1.2","placeId":"mysuru"}', '{"mysore-palace","mysore-chamundi-hill","mysore-brindavan-gardens","mysore-somnathpur-temple","mysore-st-philomenas"}')
