VALUES ('uttara-kannada', 'Uttara Kannada (Gokarna & Dandeli)', 'uttara-kannada', 'ಉತ್ತರ ಕನ್ನಡ', 'Coastal', 'Coastal', 'Pristine Coastlines, Holy Temples & River Rafting', 'Where the Arabian Sea kisses the evergreen Sahyadri cliffs. Renowned for Gokarna’s Om Beach, Murudeshwara’s towering Shiva statue, Yana monolithic limestone rocks, and Kali river adventure.', 'Karwar', 'October to March', '3 - 5 Days', 'Tropical coastal warmth, gentle sea breeze, lush greenery post-monsoon', 14.5479, 74.3188, '{"Beach Trekking","White Water Rafting","Cliff Sunsets","Spiritual Shrines"}', 5, '{"imageUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/Om_Beach_Gokarna_%28259788351%29.jpeg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Om_Beach_Gokarna_(259788351).jpeg","photographer":"Wikimedia Commons / Shreeram Kushwaha","license":"CC BY 3.0","attribution":"Wikimedia Commons / CC BY 3.0","placeId":"uttara-kannada"}', '{"uk-om-beach","uk-murudeshwar","uk-yana-rocks","uk-dandeli-rafting","uk-kudle-beach"}')
