VALUES ('udupi', 'Udupi', 'udupi', 'ಉಡುಪಿ', 'Coastal', 'Coastal', 'Temple Architecture, Virgin Islands & World-Famous Cuisine', 'World-renowned for Lord Krishna temple, legendary vegetarian cuisine, tranquil Malpe beach, ancient Kapu lighthouse, and unique columnar basalt formations at St. Mary’s Islands.', 'Udupi', 'October to March', '2 - 3 Days', 'Golden coastal sunshine, warm daytime breeze, cool ocean nights', 13.3409, 74.7421, '{"Island Geotrek","Lighthouse Sunsets","Temple Darshan","Udupi Thali Feasts"}', 4, '{"imageUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/St_Mary%27s_Island%2C_Udupi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:St_Mary%27s_Island,_Udupi.jpg","photographer":"Wikimedia Commons / Ashwin06k","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","attribution":"Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 4.0","placeId":"udupi"}', '{"udupi-st-marys","udupi-krishna-matha","udupi-malpe-beach","udupi-kapu-lighthouse"}')
