VALUES ('bengaluru-urban', 'Bengaluru Urban', 'bengaluru-urban', 'ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ನಗರ', 'South Karnataka', 'South Karnataka', 'The Garden City & High-Energy Metropolis', 'Karnataka’s bustling state capital combining royal heritage (Bangalore Palace, Tipu Sultan’s Summer Palace), century-old botanical gardens (Lalbagh, Cubbon Park), and cutting-edge culinary culture.', 'Bengaluru', 'All Year Round', '2 - 3 Days', 'Pleasant subtropical highland weather (16°C - 30°C) with cool breezes', 12.9716, 77.5946, '{"Botanical Walks","Palace Tours","Filter Coffee Trails","Craft Breweries"}', 4, '{"imageUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Glasshouse_and_fountain_at_lalbagh.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Glasshouse_and_fountain_at_lalbagh.jpg","photographer":"Wikimedia Commons / Muhammad Mahdi Karim","license":"GFDL 1.2","attribution":"Wikimedia Commons / GFDL 1.2","placeId":"bengaluru-urban"}', '{"blr-bangalore-palace","blr-lalbagh","blr-cubbon-park","blr-tipu-palace"}')
